OL,3,GNEWSAThefts fall at London stations
OL,4,Afollowing crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuggage theft at London's King's Cross
OL,7,Fand St Pancras stations has decreased
OL,8,Ffollowing a police crackdown on
OL,9,Fcriminal gangs targeting passengers.
OL,11,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said
OL,12,Fafter launching an operation targeting
OL,13,Fthieves stealing high-value luggage
OL,14,Flast December it had seen a 15%
OL,15,Fdecrease in theft of passenger
OL,16,Fproperty, which includes suitcases.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
