OL,3,GNEWSAThefts fall at London stations
OL,4,Afollowing crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FBTP said the ongoing operation, which
OL,7,Finvolves uniformed and plain-clothed
OL,8,Fofficers, also saw an 18% decline in
OL,9,Ftheft and burglary offences from April
OL,10,Fto September this year, compared to the
OL,11,Fsame period in 2025.
OL,13,FSupt Nicholas Sedgemore from BTP said
OL,14,Fthe action came after police identified
OL,15,Fa series of "organised" thefts.
